    "description"     "[h1]Hello, Comrade![/h1]Are loyal dumpers and tanker trucks backed up three kilometers down the highway waiting for sleepy border clerks to shovel gravel or pump fuel at a snail's pace? Meanwhile, is your domestic logistics network already tuned just how you like it?

Rejoice! By decree of the [b]Supreme Soviet Border Logistics Directorate[/b], you can now boost (or slow down) [b]Load[/b] and [b]Unload[/b] speeds exclusively at [b]Customs Houses[/b] ([i]$TYPE_CUSTOMHOUSE[/i]) right inside the game using [b]F9[/b] - while every domestic warehouse, station, and factory across your Republic stays at 100% vanilla speed!

{EDITION_HEADER}
Source code & releases: [url=https://github.com/ZydraHydra/WorkersAndResources-Modding]ZydraHydra GitHub[/url]

[b]Alpha Field Dispatch:[/b] Treat this mod as an early [b]Alpha[/b] release. It has been tested on active WRSR `1.1.1.13` and `1.2.0.9` border setups and needs more field testing on huge late-game republics with dense rail and road Customs hubs. Back up your saves first and report any issues on GitHub!

[h1]Wait - What is a DLL Mod? (Step-by-Step Setup)[/h1]Ordinary Steam Workshop mods only add buildings or vehicles. Because [b]CustomsSpeedControl[/b] adds an in-game [b]F9[/b] overlay and live cargo-transfer scaling, it needs a [b]Mod Loader[/b] alongside the game. Simply clicking Play in Steam will [b]not[/b] load DLL mods on its own.

Both [b]Glorious Republic Mod Loader (GRML)[/b] and [b]TesmioLoader (v0.4.6+)[/b] automatically find subscribed Steam Workshop DLL mods - [b]no manual file copying required[/b]:

[b]Option A - Glorious Republic Mod Loader (GRML - Recommended):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Subscribe to this mod ([b]CustomsSpeedControl[/b]) - Workshop ID [i]{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}[/i].
[*] Subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3846999477]Glorious Republic Mod Loader (GRML)[/url] ([url=https://github.com/ZydraHydra/GloriousRepublicModLoader]GitHub[/url]).
[*] Open [b]GloriousRepublicModLoader.exe[/b] from:
[code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\3846999477\GloriousRepublicModLoader.exe[/code]
(Tip: create a Desktop shortcut or add it to Steam as a Non-Steam Game.)
[*] Tick [b]CustomsSpeedControl[/b], click [b]Launch[/b], and press [b]F9[/b] in-game! (GRML provides the unified F9 Mod Settings hub, OTA offset updates, and automatic savegame backups.)
[/list]
[b]Option B - TesmioLoader (v0.4.6+ - Legacy Alternative):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Subscribe to this mod ([b]CustomsSpeedControl[/b]) - Workshop ID [i]{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}[/i].
[*] Download & extract [url=https://github.com/MaxLegend/TesmioLoader/releases]TesmioLoader (v0.4.6+)[/url] into your WRSR game directory ([url=https://maxlegend.github.io/TesmioLoaderDocs/#/getting-started]Docs[/url]).
[*] Run [b]tesmiolauncher.exe[/b]. Since v0.4, TesmioLoader automatically scans your Steam Workshop folder and lists subscribed DLL plugins (if your Workshop is in a separate Steam library, set it in the launcher / [i]workshop_path[/i]).
[*] Tick [b]CustomsSpeedControl[/b], launch WRSR, and press [b]F9[/b] in-game!
[/list]
(Manual/Non-Steam only: this Workshop item's DLL lives at [code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}\plugins\CustomsSpeedControl.dll[/code] -> copy into [code]<Game Dir>\plugins\[/code] if you aren't using Steam Workshop scanning.)

[h1]Operating Border Logistics Control (In-Game)[/h1][list]
[*] Press [b]F9[/b] anytime in-game to open [b]WRSR Tweaks [F9][/b] -> [b]Customs Speed[/b] tab (or [b]Esc[/b] to close).
[*] [b]Load & Unload Multipliers (0.25x - 100.0x):[/b] Tune imports ([b]Load[/b]) and exports ([b]Unload[/b]) independently. Drag a slider, click a quick preset, or [b]Ctrl+Click[/b] a slider to type an exact multiplier. Changes apply immediately on the next tick.
[*] [b]Quick Presets:[/b] One-click [b]1x[/b], [b]2x[/b], [b]5x[/b], [b]10x[/b], [b]25x[/b], [b]50x[/b], and [b]100x[/b] buttons set both Load and Unload multipliers at once ([b]1x[/b] restores vanilla border speed).
[*] [b]Affect Rail (Trains & Wagons):[/b] Toggle whether multipliers apply to trains & wagons docked at Customs Houses. When enabled, trains keep their natural relative speed advantage over road trucks.
[*] [b]Save Config (Ctrl+S):[/b] Writes settings to [i]CustomsSpeedControl.ini[/i] beside the plugin DLL.
[/list]
[h1]Practical Examples (Comrade's Playbook)[/h1][list]
[*] [b]Eliminate Truck Border Jams:[/b] Set [i]Load = 10x[/i] / [i]Unload = 10x[/i] (or [i]25x-100x[/i] for instant bay turnover) so small road Customs posts handle heavy republic traffic without touching domestic factory/warehouse transfer speeds.
[*] [b]Asymmetric Import vs. Export Tuning:[/b] Set [i]Load = 5x[/i] for fast import pickups while leaving [i]Unload = 1x-2x[/i] for realistic export unloading.
[*] [b]Speed Up Trucks Only:[/b] Uncheck [b]Affect Rail[/b] so road vehicles clear congested road gates fast while long freight trains load and unload at vanilla speed.
[/list]
[h1]Five-Year Plan Guarantees (Save-Safe & Lightweight)[/h1][list]
[*] [b]Customs Houses ONLY:[/b] Strictly verifies target building type [i]$TYPE_CUSTOMHOUSE[/i] (20). Domestic stations, warehouses, silos, and factories remain untouched.
[*] [b]Pre-Clamp Rate Scaling:[/b] Scales cargo transfer delta-time before building modifiers and capacity clamping, so vehicle/storage limits are never overflowed.
[*] [b]100% Save-Safe:[/b] Settings live cleanly in [i]CustomsSpeedControl.ini[/i] next to the DLL (binary WRSR save files are never modified).
[/list]
[h1]Companion Mod (Border Logistics Suite)[/h1][list]
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3845533384][b]TradePriceLimits[/b][/url] - Stop Distribution Offices from dispatching imports above your [b]Max Buy[/b] cap or exports below your [b]Min Sell[/b] floor ([b]RUB[/b] & [b]USD[/b], Fixed or Base % inflation-resilient) via the [b]F8[/b] overlay. Works cleanly alongside CustomsSpeedControl!
[/list]{CHANGELOG_SECTION}"
